Description: Test suite for QAT zstd-plugin userspace package
Author: Vilem Marsik <vmarsik@redhat.com> and Denis Aleksandrov <daleksan@redhat.com>
Links: The Intel QAT configuration script is from
https://intel.github.io/quickassist/qatlib/configuration.html
README:
This test suite is meant to be run using the `bkr workflow-kernel` or `bkr workflow-tomorrow`
utility. At every run of the test suite, the QE must include the following:
--task https://gitlab.cee.redhat.com/beaker/forked/beaker-core-tasks/-/archive/master/beaker-core-tasks-master.tar.gz#command --taskparam CMDS_TO_RUN="dnf install -y <link to qat-zsd-plugin test target package rpm>"
--task https://gitlab.cee.redhat.com/beaker/forked/beaker-core-tasks/-/archive/master/beaker-core-tasks-master.tar.gz#command --taskparam CMDS_TO_RUN="dnf install -y --enablerepo='*' qatlib-devel nasm"
